    <string name="label_seed">Seed</string>
    <string name="note_qs_autosave">Changes are saved automatically. Usually you don\'t need to alter temperature, top_p, frequency penalty, presence penalty and seed params. But if you need to do so you can. Please note that it\'s not recommended to change both temperature and top_p params as you may receive unexpected results. The default temperature is 0.7, default top_p is 1.0 and default values for penalties are 0.0.</string>
    <string name="label_logit_bias">Logit Bias</string>
    <string name="quick_logit_bias_hint">Logit Bias changes how likely the model is to use specific words or tokens. Positive values make the selected token more likely. Negative values make it less likely. Strong values can make replies repetitive, unnatural, or difficult to generate, so this is mainly useful when you need to encourage or discourage something very specific. Tap to Set to choose a saved configuration.\n\nGeneral Recommended Default: Not Set</string>
    <string name="quick_seed_hint">A Seed gives the provider a repeatable starting number for its random choices. With the same model and settings, repeating a seed may produce a similar reply, but results are not guaranteed to match across providers, model updates, or other setting changes. Leave this blank when you want normal variation.\n\nGeneral Recommended Default: Blank</string>
