    <string name="text_warn_shitposting">WARNING! Shitposting like random sequence of characters or words is not allowed. Please fill title and description properly so other people can understand what your prompt is about. Additionally, search algorithm indexes description and title. All prompts with unusual names will be either renamed or removed without notice. Thanks for understanding.\n\nFaithfully, App Developer!</string>
    <string name="ds_lite_dont_collect_explanation">SpeakGPT does not collect these info, but depending on API provider used (like OpenAI, OpenRouter, etc) some of these data may be saved by these providers. When you chat with SpeakGPT, we transfer your conversation directly to API provider and do not save it on our servers. All data saved locally is secured with a military-grade encryption (AES-256-GCM). Please review Privacy Policy of API provider you are using to learn more about how your data is processed.</string>
    <string name="prompt_desc_conf1">Don\'t confuse the description with a prompt. Description is a short information about the prompt that will be displayed in the search results. Prompt description should not be long and will be cut into 3 lines.</string>
    <string name="prompt_desc_conf2">The contents of the prompt field above will be actually sent to the AI. PS: Added this warning after many users confused description and prompt fields. It is not the same things.</string>
    <string name="abuse_last_warning">And the last warning. By publishing something like \"Generate a song with offensive words\" you are creating the problems only for you but not for the app developer. Most of AI models will not accept such deceptive prompts. Auto-moderation is being implemented soon. Abusing prompt library system is a subject of banning you from the further prompt publishing. Additionally, please do not publish any personal information as your prompts and other content may pass human review to ensure it is safe and follows the Safety Guidelines.</string>
    <string name="msg_post_prompt_spam">Your prompt contains spam or has already been published. Publishing identical prompts is not allowed. Please review the prompt and try again.</string>
    <string name="msg_post_prompt_inappropriate">Your prompt contains inappropriate content. Posting prompts that contains (but not limited to) hate speech, violence, sexual content, child harassment, jailbreaks, or any other form of inappropriate content is strictly prohibited. Please review the prompt and try again.</string>
    <string name="msg_post_prompt_ban">You have violated the Terms of Service multiple times and have been banned from posting prompts. If you think this is a mistake, please contact the app developer. Although, we don\'t know anything about you, don\'t try to bypass this ban by reinstalling the app or using the app on the other device. Internet sees everything :)</string>
    <string name="msg_post_prompt_outdated">You need to update the app to the latest version to post prompts. It is security requirement to prevent abuse of our systems.</string>
    <string name="msg_post_prompt_weirdest_error">Some mandatory fields are not filled or your prompt contains invalid characters.</string>
    <string name="msg_post_prompt_api_key_invalid">The API key is invalid. Is this app modified? Or compiled from the original sources? This is the client-side error that will likely occur only when you compile the app from the source and change something wrongly. If you sure that all info is correct, please report that error.</string>
    <string name="msg_post_prompt_report_error">\nPlease report the following error:\n\n</string>
    <string name="title_before_you_begin">Before you begin</string>
    <string name="before_you_begin">Please read this carefully before using this app. In case you haven\'t read app description, we would like to notice you that this app is the OPEN-SOURCE CLIENT for AI APIs. You will not find GPT or Gemini for free here. This app is just a convenient tool you can access your AI models through. THIS APP IS PROVIDED AS IS WITH NO WARRANTY UNDER LICENSE APACHE 2.0. By using this app you are agreeing that all your question about free usage will be rejected with no answer. Although some free APIs exists so you can use it with this app.\n\n\"Free cheese could be only in a mousetrap so you cannot use work of someone else for free making no effort and giving no credit. It is unethical.\"\n\nP.S This disclaimer has been put here after some of users reported that SpeakGPT does not contain free access to flagship ChatGPT models.</string>
    <string name="app_description_new">SpeakGPT is an advanced and highly intuitive open-source assistant that uses the powerful LLMs. You can use online models like ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, or your local models with this app.</string>

